- **The effect is observable.** Whatever the autorun does when it fires — calls an injected callback, sets an observable flag, writes to a spy — recorded so the test can see it. If the autorun body isn't reachable from outside the store, provide the seam (an injected callback or an exposed observable) rather than trying to assert on MobX internals.
